  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79466,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jiù shì zuì dà de chéng shì\n就是最大的城市"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82866,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tā men de rén kǒu hěn duō\n它们的人口很多"
